[2026-07-17T11:59:30.697Z] • A unit's purpose may be to act as a helper for some other unit which has
[2026-07-17T11:59:30.697Z]   a requirement dependency on it.
[2026-07-17T11:59:30.697Z] • A unit may be started when needed via activation (socket, path, timer,
